  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add chipotle peppers and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Add chicken and cook until browned and cooked through, about 5-6 minutes.",
    "Add cumin, paprika, salt, coriander, mustard seeds, and shio-cure; stir to combine.",
    "Warm tortillas by wrapping them in a damp paper towel and microwaving for 20-30 seconds.",
    "Assemble tacos by placing cooked chicken onto a tortilla, topping with cabbage, radish, cilantro, and a squeeze of lime juice.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
